flowchart TB
  SD[Service Discovery]
  SD --> EUREKA[Netflix Eureka]
  EUREKA --> SVR[Eureka Server]
  EUREKA --> CLNT[Eureka Client]
  CLNT --> REG[Service Registration]
  CLNT --> HB[Heartbeat / Renew]
  CLNT --> META[Instance Metadata]
  EUREKA --> SP[Self-Preservation]
  EUREKA --> HCHK[Health Checks]

  SD --> DISCO[Discovery Patterns]
  DISCO --> CS[Client-Side Discovery]
  DISCO --> SS[Server-Side Discovery]
  DISCO --> SR[Self-Registration]
  DISCO --> TP[Third-Party Registration]

  SD --> LB[Load Balancing]
  LB --> SCLB[Spring Cloud LoadBalancer]
  SCLB --> RR[RoundRobin]
  SCLB --> RND[Random]
  SCLB --> CUST[Custom Strategies]
  LB --> RT[LoadBalanced RestTemplate]
  LB --> WC[LoadBalanced WebClient]
